{
  "assessment_scope": "Workflow-final-verification for all seven work entries of 2026-09-12-unified-validation-model, complete main-to-branch diff, model and retained legacy boundaries, requirement-to-proof allocation C1–C11, generated consumers, lifecycle closeout and Git/PR readiness.",
  "change_id": "2026-09-12-unified-validation-model",
  "changes": [
    "Organized System composition around Skill behavior, CLI behavior and Engineering realization, with scoped submodels and preserved stable requirement/example identities.",
    "Unified test criteria and validation execution under Engineering Validation; retired the separate Test owner and exact mapped old specifications, architecture clauses, cache scripts/options and inspected disposable default cache.",
    "Implemented one trusted bounded execution engine for selected, broad and main validation, with real independent case execution, dependency barriers, resource budgets, fresh receipts, fail-fast accounting and owned process cleanup.",
    "Adopted 278 real cases across three suites and retained command execution for other suites; aligned published guidance, package fixtures and current navigation while preserving historical records and unmigrated authority."
  ],
